        "id": 1003873
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-02-12T09:47:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Immutability and persistence are two orthogonal properties, I don\u0027t see any coupling here between these two properties. Forwarding cache evictions between primaries is a mean to remove stale entries from cache on other primaries.",
      "parentUuid": "b489e48c_fa9fd47e",
      "revId": "cc0158e20c2db5080e51e0439c39cfccf2814314",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
